{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Retire When Age 是一款退休計算工具，只需填寫 4 個欄位，便能推算你何時累積到足夠資產退休，或何時可以停止為他人工作；若只提供其中 2 項資料，同樣可算出今天退休所需金額。程式不採用蒙地卡羅模擬，也不需要你自行設定一個隨意的退休年齡，適合想及早規劃財務的上班族。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>四個欄位算出退休時間</h2>\n<p>流程只需填寫 4 個欄位，毋須自行設定退休年齡，也不必處理複雜的蒙地卡羅模擬；若只提供其中 2 項資料，程式同樣能推算今天退休所需金額。每個欄位都附有簡短影片，逐步解釋背後概念，讓你在計算的同時累積財務知識。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-1-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-2-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-3-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Retire When Age</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T20:19:30.648236+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}